<title>ARGENTINA: Bagley Q1 net $2.67 mln after gain.</title>
<headline>Bagley Q1 net $2.67 mln after gain.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net $2.67 million vs N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: Biscuit maker Bagley S.A., controlled by France's Danone, said the net profit was due to a $5 million extraordinary gain. Net assets were $180.8 million. ((--Gary Regenstreif, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0618))</p>
